                "contextual_cvss_reasoning": "deepmerge-ts 7.1.5 is present only as a transitive dependency of @prisma/config and html-to-text (verified from node_modules/*/package.json dependency edges); the application's package.json does not list it and rg over src/ found no import of deepmerge-ts. @prisma/config's use of the package is internal to the Prisma CLI/config loading (operator-controlled config files, not request input), and html-to-text is not imported by application code (the mailer has its own hand-rolled htmlToText at src/utils/mailer.ts:33). No attacker-controlled entry point reaches the vulnerable merge APIs, so availability is scored L as a worst-case stack exhaustion with high attack complexity, and confidentiality/integrity are N."
              }
            }
          }
        },
