                "contextual_cvss_reasoning": "uuid 10.0.0 is present only as a transitive dependency (dependents verified from node_modules: firebase-admin, gaxios, gcp-metadata, google-gax, nanoid re-exports). rg over src/ found no import of uuid; the application uses crypto.randomUUID() and its own generators instead. The vulnerability requires the application to call uuid v3/v5/v6 with an externally supplied output buffer and attacker-influenced offset — neither the app nor, to my inspection, any dependent's reachable path does this with request data. All impact metrics are therefore N with high attack complexity, reflecting a supply-chain hygiene item rather than a reachable flaw."
